1
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,525
别动，孩子，现在一切都会好起来的。
Hold still, son, everything's gonna be all right now.

2
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,027
不！不！我们把他丢下了！
No! No! We left him!

3
00:00:34,006 --> 00:00:35,707
真不敢相信他留在了后面。
I can't believe he stayed behind.

4
00:00:37,812 --> 00:00:40,404
他做出了最大的牺牲，救了我们所有人。
He made the ultimate sacrifice and saved us all.

5
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,283
我们为什么丢下他？
Why did we leave him?

6
00:00:47,513 --> 00:00:49,923
我们得回去，我们得回去。
We have to go back, we have to go back.

7
00:01:20,690 --> 00:01:22,978
算了吧，他走了。
Come on, he's gone,now.

8
00:01:25,318 --> 00:01:28,930
这个倒霉日子终于结束了。
This bad day is finally over.

9
00:02:04,450 --> 00:02:05,347
婊子们。
Bitches.

